data/
# ...but the Phase 6 demo payload IS committed (demo/DATA_CONTRACT.md): the bare `data/`
# pattern above matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# demo/data/. Re-included explicitly rather than anchoring the rule to /data/, so the
# top-level dataset dir keeps exactly the coverage it had.
!demo/data/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
models/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.env
.DS_Store
